## MCP

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "{{ source_slug }}": {
      "command": "uvx",
{% set ns = namespace(env=[]) %}
{% if tenant_param %}
{% set ns.env = ['"' ~ tenant_list_var ~ '": "acme"', '"' ~ tenant_prefix ~ '_ACME_' ~ tenant_field ~ '": "..."'] %}
{% endif %}
{% for name in plain_vars %}
{% set ns.env = ns.env + ['"' ~ name ~ '": "..."'] %}
{% endfor %}
{% set entry = 'xippios-' ~ source_slug ~ '-mcp' ~ ('-read' if write_server else '') %}
{% if ns.env %}
      "args": ["--from", "xippios-{{ source_slug }}[mcp]", "{{ entry }}"],
      "env": { {{ ns.env | join(', ') }} }
{% else %}
      "args": ["--from", "xippios-{{ source_slug }}[mcp]", "{{ entry }}"]
{% endif %}
    }
  }
}
```

Tools are read-only and named `{{ tool_prefix }}_<verb>_<noun>`. Results are capped, at
200 rows or 64 KB unless a tool has a cap of its own, with a note on how to see the rest.
`--http` serves streamable HTTP instead of stdio.
{% if tenant_param %}
Without an option a server serves every declared {{ tenant_param }}, and every tool but
`{{ tool_prefix }}_list_{{ tenant_param }}s` takes `{{ tenant_param }}`; `--{{ tenant_param | replace('_', '-') }} acme` binds it to one, so every tool acts
on `acme` and takes no `{{ tenant_param }}`, and it stops at startup unless `acme` is declared with its key.
{% endif %}
{% if write_server %}

Write tools run in a server of their own, `xippios-{{ source_slug }}-mcp-write`, never in the
read server: every write tool previews its change unless called with `confirm=true`. It
carries no authentication, so `--http` serves it on a loopback `--host` (`127.0.0.1`,
`localhost`, `::1`) only; `--allow-remote` serves it beyond, behind a gateway that
authenticates.

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "{{ source_slug }}-write": {
      "command": "uvx",
{% if ns.env %}
      "args": ["--from", "xippios-{{ source_slug }}[mcp]", "xippios-{{ source_slug }}-mcp-write"],
      "env": { {{ ns.env | join(', ') }} }
{% else %}
      "args": ["--from", "xippios-{{ source_slug }}[mcp]", "xippios-{{ source_slug }}-mcp-write"]
{% endif %}
    }
  }
}
```
{% endif %}

